      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ione%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ione sits on the west bank of the Pend Oreille River as it flows north toward Canada, surrounded by steep Selkirk Mountains.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
